-- Loads the six client testimonials the website showed before the CMS (approved by the owner, so published with the client's agreement
-- recorded). Their logos are already in the public bucket under testimonial/<id>/logo1.png.
-- Safe to run twice: a row whose id exists is left alone. Run it with `npm run seed:testimonials` (after the deploy), or paste it into a SQL client.

BEGIN;

ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

COMMIT;
